      48.02,
      488.84,
      286.84,
      563.49
    ],
    "text": "Land Ministry\u2019s No. : 4-3/15/2016/VE/481. I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      563.03,
      286.66,
      677.87
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired : The Allotment of Land called Bubulehenawatte/Sirikandurewatte (Finehillwatte) in extent of 3.6588 Hectares depicted as the Lot No. 01 in Sheet 1, Block 03 of the F.V.P 239 of the Plan No. R/AYG/2019/706 dated 20.10.2023, in possession of Superintendent of Surveys Ratnapura, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village called Udugala in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 193A of Udugala in Kukulu Korale Palle Pattu Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
