    ],
    "text": "Division of Ayagama in Ratnapura District of the Sabaragamuwa Province. Current Claimant - State :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      302.35,
      435.11,
      541.64,
      558.33
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land servitude are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Ayagama Divisional Secretariat on 08.05.2024 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 24.04.2024 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
